# Line-ending normalization
#
# Prettier (npm run format:check) requires LF. Without this file, Windows
# checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) materialize CRLF working trees and the
# format gate fails for every file, while Linux checkouts see LF blobs.
# Forcing eol=lf for text files makes the working tree, the index, and the
# blobs agree on every platform, and keeps `git status` clean cross-machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Scripts that must keep LF even on Windows (deploy + systemd units).
deploy/deploy.sh text eol=lf
deploy/systemd/nlo.service text eol=lf

# Binaries — never line-ending-normalize.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite-shm binary
*.sqlite-wal binary
*.key binary
*.pem binary
